{"id":"n72432-1-7","stage":2,"title":"한동안 · 一度","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72432-1-7-1","ko":"지수야, 한동안 안 보이던데 어디 여행이라도 다녀왔어?","zh":"智秀啊，好久没见到你了，是去旅行了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"한동안","meaning":"一度，一时，一阵子，长时间","explanation":"한동안：一度，一时，一阵子，长时间。","readings":[{"term":"한동안","audio":"/audio/9efbe5bbba69a9d59231.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72432","senseId":"1","lemma":"한동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한동안","audio":"/audio/9efbe5bbba69a9d59231.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"보이던데","meaning":"看见（안 보이다：看不见人影）","explanation":"안 보이던데：之前一直没见到你；보이다 在这里指能够被看见，不是“看起来像……”。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"1","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이던데","audio":"/audio/6b881167f44d7cb5114c.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"一个地方","explanation":"어디：一个地方。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"여행이라도","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReadi